{"id": "DewpdMXJrwB", "title": "Video by harshithsai.batthini", "description": "Comment \"COURT\" and I'll DM you the free Claude skill that puts your business idea on trial in front of 12 Claudes. Follow so the DM lands 📩\n\n👇 READ BELOW for how the trial works:\n\n1. Ask Claude if your idea is good and it says yes. Every time. So this skill makes it argue with itself.\n2. One Claude is the lawyer who says your idea will fail. Another says it will work.\n3. 12 Claude jurors read both sides and vote guilty or not guilty. Blind. No juror sees the other votes.\n4. Every juror plays a different person: an accountant, your customer, your biggest rival, and more.\n5. A judge Claude reads the votes and gives you the verdict.\n\nWhat you get: the truth about your idea, not a pat on the back.\nWhy it works: one AI wants to please you. Twelve strangers with different jobs, voting in secret, can't.\n\nSave this one for later.\nComment \"COURT\" for the skill.\n\n#claudeai #claude #aitools #business", "channel": "harshithsai.batthini", "uploader_id": "27038582826", "uploader": "Harshith Sai Batthini | AI tools & updates", "timestamp": 1792593778, "like_count": 18, "comment_count": 14, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-29006585995639689a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 62.908, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fird1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNq0EwZ0mrW2IdX6_coQa7eUoLMCVaKfWtwi62kOMjq778TJCaGRNuZFZKr6XOGO9MjCRudwdKLgeKawLpoCPiNzCjxNUo57FURMWU.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=AdpAlZLZpiq5b3pMLfCPPtbO8VMH6G14zvCEhw-fI5PaOXqjJ63FyuZjXiQGfOOSg1M&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fird1-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=ipx2R_EWWIoQ7kNvwHT0Aqs&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=dAzWJ4ROtyRIoQVVeVWc-Q&_nc_ss=7a22e&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQODLsTM7TZRbD8-Oq0XhfpOPH5V5pOuPgceQsExLshhLw&oe=6ADC565C", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": tr